## 🔍 상세 컴포넌트

### 1. 사용자 레이어
```mermaid
graph LR
    A[👤 웹 브라우저] -->|HTTP/HTTPS| B[📱 모바일 앱]
    B --> C[🌐 API 요청]
    style A fill:#e3f2fd
    style B fill:#e3f2fd
    style C fill:#bbdefb
```

### 2. Kubernetes 내부 통신
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 사용자
    participant LB as ⚖️ LoadBalancer
    participant SVC as 🔄 K8s Service
    participant POD as 🐳 Pod
    participant DB as 🗄️ MySQL
    participant Cache as ⚡ Redis

    User->>LB: HTTP Request
    LB->>SVC: Forward to Service
    SVC->>POD: Route to Pod
    POD->>DB: Query Database
    DB-->>POD: Return Data
    POD->>Cache: Check Cache
    Cache-->>POD: Cached Data
    POD-->>SVC: Response
    SVC-->>LB: Forward Response
    LB-->>User: HTTP Response
```

---

## 📦 리소스 상세

### ConfigMap (chat-config)
```yaml
데이터:
├─ DB_HOST: 54.116.26.182
├─ DB_PORT: 3306
├─ DB_NAME: coreconnect
├─ REDIS_HOST: 54.116.26.182
├─ REDIS_PORT: 6379
├─ AWS_REGION: ap-northeast-2
├─ JWT_EXPIRATION: 86400000
└─ SECURITY_MODE: open
```

### Secret (chat-secret)
```yaml
데이터 (암호화됨):
├─ DB_USERNAME: ********
├─ DB_PASSWORD: ********
├─ REDIS_PASSWORD: ********
├─ JWT_SECRET: ********
├─ AWS_ACCESS_KEY: ********
├─ AWS_SECRET_KEY: ********
└─ SENDGRID_API_KEY: ********
```

### Deployment (chat-service)
```yaml
스펙:
├─ Replicas: 3개
├─ Image: ECR (230438301300.dkr.ecr.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/chat-service:latest)
├─ Resources:
│   ├─ Requests: CPU 100m, Memory 256Mi
│   └─ Limits: CPU 500m, Memory 512Mi
├─ Env From:
│   ├─ ConfigMapRef: chat-config
│   └─ SecretRef: chat-secret
└─ Strategy: RollingUpdate
```

### Service (chat-service)
```yaml
스펙:
├─ Type: LoadBalancer
├─ Port: 80 (External)
├─ TargetPort: 8080 (Pod)
└─ Selector: app=chat-service
```

### HPA (Horizontal Pod Autoscaler)
```yaml
스펙:
├─ Min Replicas: 3
├─ Max Replicas: 10
└─ Target: CPU 70%
```

### PDB (Pod Disruption Budget)
```yaml
스펙:
└─ Min Available: 2
   (최소 2개 Pod는 항상 Running)
```

