## 🔄 트래픽 흐름

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[👤 User] -->|1. HTTP Request| B[⚖️ ALB]
    B -->|2. Forward| C[🔄 K8s Service<br/>Port 80]
    C -->|3. Load Balance| D[🐳 Pod 1]
    C -->|3. Load Balance| E[🐳 Pod 2]
    C -->|3. Load Balance| F[🐳 Pod 3]
    D -->|4. Query| G[(🗄️ MySQL)]
    E -->|4. Query| G
    F -->|4. Query| G
    D -->|5. Cache| H[(⚡ Redis)]
    E -->|5. Cache| H
    F -->|5. Cache| H
    G -->|6. Data| D
    H -->|6. Data| E
    D -->|7. Response| C
    E -->|7. Response| C
    F -->|7. Response| C
    C -->|8. Return| B
    B -->|9. HTTP Response| A

    style A fill:#e1f5ff
    style B fill:#ff9800
    style C fill:#4caf50
    style D fill:#2196f3
    style E fill:#2196f3
    style F fill:#2196f3
    style G fill:#00897b
    style H fill:#d32f2f
```

