## 📊 자동 스케일링 동작

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Normal: 초기 상태
    Normal --> ScaleUp: CPU > 70%
    ScaleUp --> Scaling: HPA 작동
    Scaling --> MaxReplicas: Max 10개 도달
    MaxReplicas --> Scaling: CPU < 70%
    Scaling --> Normal: 안정화
    Normal --> ScaleDown: CPU < 50%
    ScaleDown --> MinReplicas: Min 3개 유지
    MinReplicas --> Normal: 트래픽 증가

    note right of Normal
        Replicas: 3
        CPU: 40-70%
    end note

    note right of ScaleUp
        Replicas: 3 → 5
        CPU: 70-90%
    end note

    note right of MaxReplicas
        Replicas: 10
        CPU: 60-80%
    end note
```

